{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1537240-reckoning-of-new-york","id":1537240,"title":"Reckoning of New York","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-06-11T17:58:22-07:00","id":1537240,"title":"Reckoning of New York","content":"There's a third and final visual novel being released for World of Darkness' New York by Night setting before we're getting Bloodlines 2. This time we've got a Ravnos as the protagonist and an Asian American woman.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2658720/Vampire_The_Masquerade__Reckoning_of_New_York/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2658720/Vampire_The_Masquerade__Reckoning_of_New_York/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2658720/Vampire_The_Masquerade__Reckoning_of_New_York/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://store.steampowered.com/app/2658720/Vampire_The_Masquerade__Reckoning_of_New_York/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> * Julia is a Primogen so the &quot;Good Ending&quot; is canon.<br /> * The Toreador Fledgling shows up as a Hound, so Coteries has a canon ending still.<br /> * The Hunters are utterly wrecking shit in New York and have wiped out most of the Dustborn, including their Primogen.<br /> * You're playing a Ravnos con woman of Asian descent. You'll also get a campaign path to play your Caitiff bodyguard.<br /> * D'Angelo is confirmed to have been the head of your coterie and is more your sire than your actual sire-sire.<br /> * Feeding is an optional rule as is Hunters showing up if you break the Masquerade.<br /> * The Circulatory System is a major part of this as is the blood trade.<br /> * You basically get dragooned into selling out your sire for the blood trade poaching he's done (which since it was online, may have clued in every vampire in New York to the SI). Which is actually really smart if the SI started selling blood to find the vamps who'd buy.<br /> * You can't not choose to sell him out and die so I suspect this is going to have little player choice this time around.<br /> * All of the designs appear to be photographs painted over like the V5 art in the main books. Some of them look terrible like Qadir and Panhard.<br /> * I already ship the two main characters. They have the &quot;bicker and should end up in bed&quot; vibe that television has taught me.<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}